      "extractedText": "Republic of the Philippines\nProvince of Iloilo\nMUNICIPALITY OF MIAGAO\nBIDS AND AWARDS COMMITTEE\nwebsite : www.miagao.gov.ph\nemail address: Iqumiagao@yahoo.com\nINVITATION TO BID FOR THE CONSTRUCTION OF MIAGAO\nWEST CENTRAL ELEM. SCHOOL WATER SYSTEM,\nMIAGAO, ILOILO\n1.\nThe Municipality of Miagao through the Budget for the Contract Approved by the\nSanggunian, Trust Fund Provincial Aid, Budget Year 2018 intends to apply the sum\nof P 300,850.00 being the Approved Budget for the Contract (ABC) to payments under\nthe contract for Supply and Delivery of Materials and Supplies for the Construction of\nMiagao West Central Elem. School Water System, Miagao, Iloilo. Bids received in\nexcess of the ABC shall be automatically rejected at bid opening.\n2.\nThe Municipality of Miagao now invites bids for the following:\nITEM NO.\nQUANTITY\nUNIT\nITEM DESCRIPTION\n1\n17\npcs\n1.0m Ø x 0.45 RC pipes\n2\n30\nbags\nportland cement\n3\n7.5\ncu.m\nscreened gravel\n4\n3.5\ncu.m\nwashed sand\n5\n26\npcs\n10mm Ø x 6.0 RSB\n6\n3\npcs\n3/16\" thk x 1 1/2\" x 1 1/2\" x 6m angle bar\n7\n2\nshts\n0.4mm x 3' x 8' plain GI sheet\n8\n50\npcs\n3/16\"Ø c 1/2\" blind rivets\n9\n2\npcs\n500ml roof sealant\n10mmØ x 2 1/2\" stainless steel bolt w/ nut\n10\n4\npcs\n&washer\n11\n1\npc\nfabricated door lock (barrel type)\n12\n1\npc\n2\" padlock\n13\n2\npcs\n2' x 3\" brass hinge\n14\n1\ngal\nred oxide primer\n15\n13\nkgs\n#18 G.l tie wire\n16\n10\nkgs\nweilding electrodes 1300\n17\n2\npcs\n2\" paint brush\n18\n2\nft\nsand paper #120\n19\n9\npcs\nhacksaw blade\n20\n3\npcs\n1/4\" x 4' x 8' ord plywood\n21\n8\npcs\n2\" x 2\" x10' coco lumber\n22\n12\npc\n16mmØ x 6.0 RSB\n23\n1\nkgs\n12mmØ x 6.0 RSB\n24\n2\nkgs\n1\" common wire nails\n1",
      "ocrText": "Republic of the Philippines\nProvince of Iloilo\nMUNICIPALITY OF MIAGAO\nBIDS AND AWARDS COMMITTEE\nwebsite : www.miagao.gov.ph\nemail address: Iqumiagao@yahoo.com\nINVITATION TO BID FOR THE CONSTRUCTION OF MIAGAO\nWEST CENTRAL ELEM. SCHOOL WATER SYSTEM,\nMIAGAO, ILOILO\n1.\nThe Municipality of Miagao through the Budget for the Contract Approved by the\nSanggunian, Trust Fund Provincial Aid, Budget Year 2018 intends to apply the sum\nof P 300,850.00 being the Approved Budget for the Contract (ABC) to payments under\nthe contract for Supply and Delivery of Materials and Supplies for the Construction of\nMiagao West Central Elem. School Water System, Miagao, Iloilo. Bids received in\nexcess of the ABC shall be automatically rejected at bid opening.\n2.\nThe Municipality of Miagao now invites bids for the following:\nITEM NO.\nQUANTITY\nUNIT\nITEM DESCRIPTION\n1\n17\npcs\n1.0m Ø x 0.45 RC pipes\n2\n30\nbags\nportland cement\n3\n7.5\ncu.m\nscreened gravel\n4\n3.5\ncu.m\nwashed sand\n5\n26\npcs\n10mm Ø x 6.0 RSB\n6\n3\npcs\n3/16\" thk x 1 1/2\" x 1 1/2\" x 6m angle bar\n7\n2\nshts\n0.4mm x 3' x 8' plain GI sheet\n8\n50\npcs\n3/16\"Ø c 1/2\" blind rivets\n9\n2\npcs\n500ml roof sealant\n10mmØ x 2 1/2\" stainless steel bolt w/ nut\n10\n4\npcs\n&washer\n11\n1\npc\nfabricated door lock (barrel type)\n12\n1\npc\n2\" padlock\n13\n2\npcs\n2' x 3\" brass hinge\n14\n1\ngal\nred oxide primer\n15\n13\nkgs\n#18 G.l tie wire\n16\n10\nkgs\nweilding electrodes 1300\n17\n2\npcs\n2\" paint brush\n18\n2\nft\nsand paper #120\n19\n9\npcs\nhacksaw blade\n20\n3\npcs\n1/4\" x 4' x 8' ord plywood\n21\n8\npcs\n2\" x 2\" x10' coco lumber\n22\n12\npc\n16mmØ x 6.0 RSB\n23\n1\nkgs\n12mmØ x 6.0 RSB\n24\n2\nkgs\n1\" common wire nails\n1",
